[Desktop Entry]
Version=1.0
Name=bmon
Comment=Bandwidth monitor
Comment[tr]=Ağ bant genişliği izleyicisi
Comment[es]=Monitor de ancho de banda
Comment[fr]=Moniteur de bande passante
Comment[de]=Bandbreiten-Monitor
Comment[ar]=مراقب عرض النطاق الترددي
Comment[ru]=Монитор пропускной способности
Comment[zh]=带宽监视器
Comment[ja]=帯域幅モニター
Comment[ko]=대역폭 모니터
Comment[pt]=Monitor de largura de banda
Comment[it]=Monitor della larghezza di banda
Comment[nl]=Bandbreedtemonitor
Comment[sv]=Bandbreddsmonitor
Comment[pl]=Monitor przepustowości
Exec=mate-terminal -- bash -c "bmon; exec bash"
Terminal=true
Type=Application
Icon=/usr/share/icons/cyrethium/terminal.png
Categories=NetworkSec;
StartupNotify=false
